## 6. Try the Game & Explore the Source

The entire philosophy behind Kreeda is proving that modern web standards already provide everything needed to build high-performance, responsive, zero-friction software.

- **Play Ennead**: [https://kreeda.games/ennead/index.html](https://kreeda.games/ennead/index.html)
- **Source Code**: [https://github.com/sudhir-patavardhan/browser-games](https://github.com/sudhir-patavardhan/browser-games)

